  "notes": {
    "a-board": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "BOARD · DECISIONS\n\nOne screen, five states (time tweak): empty, morning, midday, afternoon, final.\n\nRows: your side's cart stacked on the left, theirs on the right, first names only, no plus. 13px, never shrinks.\n\nFlag (72px, always): hangs off the center line on the side that holds the point.\n• not started: dashed, says when/where (8:40, on 12)\n• live: solid white with the margin (2 UP, ½ UP)\n• live tied: solid white on the line, hole points (3–3)\n• done: mid-grey + check, final hole points (7–5)\n• done tied: dimmer + check, on the line (6–6)\nShaded cell behind the name on the side with the point.\n\nRotations: header strip only (outlined, no fill). Live and done always open; future ones fold with a chevron. Two rotations can be LIVE at once.\n\nA hole counts once both carts played it; the flag only shows counted holes. Nothing hidden.\n\nTap a row → sheet (no X; swipe or tap away). Names once, over their numbers. Same bar/strip/detail as Matches, no green.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 3311,
      "y": 0
    },
    "a-enter": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "ENTER · FINAL\n\nThe prototype on the left is the spec. Everything computed, nothing assumed.\n\n• 4 pads: par−1 … par+2 (birdie…double), ~90% of holes for a 15–20 hcp. ‹ › slide the window one score at a time, from 1 up to double par. Tap a pad to enter, tap again to clear. Label under each pad (BIRDIE, PAR, BOGEY, DOUBLE, TRIPLE · MAX).\n• Flag in the header recomputes from counted holes only: THRU n + UP / DOWN / tied. Green when up, grey when down, outlined when tied. Tap it → Matches tab. No cup score, no low ball / low total on Enter: that's Matches.\n• Edit flips the card to the other cart (same pads, line outline, source line per name, Back). Your cart folds to a slim row with YOU.\n• Next hole just says Next hole. Grey until all four scores are in, then solid. Round done on the last hole. ‹ › in the header browse holes.\n• Green card: 011/013 component, 92px. iPhone 16 home-app frame, no scrolling.\n\nPer-hole odds that set the pad count (Shot Scope / Arccos, 15–20 hcp): birdie 2–3 · par 21–29 · bogey 41–47 · double 16–22 · triple 5–10 · quad+ 2–4 %.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 1419,
      "y": 3756
    },
    "a-matches": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "MATCHES · DECISIONS\n\nOnly your match. Layout never changes; words, fill and dots do.\n\nTop: kicker (grey until something counts, green when live), opponent, where both groups are.\nPicker: 1–6 · 7–12 · 13–18 with result; tap for that match in the same layout (history).\nCard: THRU n · YOU'RE UP n, names over scores, smooth bar with 6½ CLINCHES, pts left line.\nStrip: six holes, two dots each (top low ball, bottom low total). Solid = counted (green you, grey them, half = halved) · hatched = one cart in · dashed = nobody.\nTap a hole → four net scores as score marks + low ball / low total lines.\n\nNo hidden scores. When they're ahead you see their numbers and what to beat (C).",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 1892,
      "y": 1252
    },
    "a-setup": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "SETUP · DECISIONS\n\n② Players (16 → Team Ryder Cup fits) → ③ Game (014) → ④ Carts: paired in list order, tap two names to swap, Shuffle → ⑤ Draft: captains' carts pre-placed, snake order J A A J J A, tap a cart to take it, Skip = split in cart order → ⑥ Tee times: one cart from each side per group, tap two Team Josh carts to swap; your three matches preview → Start. Round is live: code + share text with sides, tee times, rule.\n\nDraft happens on one phone with both captains watching. Two-phone draft = V2.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2365,
      "y": 5308
    },
